  "description": "The write-scaling ladder: vertical scaling and write-optimised storage, sharding with a good key, hot-partition splitting, queues as shock absorbers, batching and sharded counters - with real numbers from Notion, Figma, Discord, DynamoDB and Kafka.",
  "hero": {
