      "class": "page-hero"
    },
    "html": "\n        <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n          <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"4\">Level 4 - Advanced</span>\n          <span class=\"time\">30 min</span>\n          <span class=\"chip company\">Amazon</span><span class=\"chip company\">Meta</span><span class=\"chip company\">Uber</span><span class=\"chip company\">Flipkart</span>\n        </div>\n        <h1>Pattern: Scaling Writes</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">Reads can be copied; writes cannot. After this page you can explain how to spread writes across machines with a good shard key, rescue a hot partition, absorb bursts with a queue, batch to cut per-write cost, and count a billion likes without one row catching fire.</p>\n      "
